---
// GENERATED WIREFRAMES — lifted verbatim from artifacts produced by the
// /wireframe skill itself (intent-eval-workspace/showcase-v2/wireframe/outputs).
// Do not hand-edit the frame markup: regenerate the artifacts and re-extract.
// The kit styles come from wireframe-kit.css (synced copy of the skill's
// design-system.css). These artifacts carry no per-artifact CSS: their
// layout is inline on the frames, so wireframe-examples.css holds only the
// marker rules. The site's [data-theme] themes everything with no JavaScript.
import '../../css/wireframe-kit.css';
import '../../css/wireframe-examples.css';
---

<div class="wf-examples">
  <div class="visual-label">The idea board: posting mechanisms</div>
  <div class="wf-ex-row">

    <div class="wf-ex wf-ex-vignette">
      <div class="wf">
          <div class="vignette">
            <div class="float" style="max-width: 280px">
              <div class="media" style="height: var(--sp-23); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                <span class="glyph glyph-lg gl-camera muted" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </div>
              <label class="field" style="margin-top: var(--sp-3)">
                <span class="field-label">Title</span>
                <input class="input" type="text" value="Blue IKEA bookshelf">
                <span class="field-hint" style="display: block">Suggested from your photo.</span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="idea-caption">
            <p class="idea-title">Photo first</p>
            <p class="idea-desc">The plus tab opens the camera and the photo suggests the title and category, so the seller types a price. A dark hallway or a denied camera permission leaves the fields empty.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wf-ex wf-ex-vignette">
      <div class="wf">
          <div class="vignette">
            <div class="float" style="max-width: 280px">
              <label class="field">
                <span class="field-label">Title</span>
                <input class="input" type="text" placeholder="Blue IKEA bookshelf">
              </label>
              <div class="field">
                <span class="field-label" id="t-cat">Category</span>
                <button class="select" aria-labelledby="t-cat">Choose a category</button>
              </div>
              <label class="field">
                <span class="field-label">Price</span>
                <input class="input" type="text" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="$0">
              </label>
              <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-block" style="margin-top: var(--sp-4)"><span class="glyph glyph-sm gl-camera" aria-hidden="true"></span>Add photos</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="idea-caption">
            <p class="idea-title">Form first</p>
            <p class="idea-desc">Title, category and price come before the photo, as on Craigslist and Marketplace. Every listing arrives complete, and a $10 lamp takes as many fields as a couch.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wf-ex wf-ex-vignette">
      <div class="wf">
          <div class="vignette">
            <div class="float" style="max-width: 280px">
              <label class="field">
                <span class="field-label">What are you getting rid of?</span>
                <input class="input" type="text" value="Blue bookshelf, $20">
              </label>
              <div class="row" style="margin-top: var(--sp-2); flex-wrap: wrap">
                <span class="badge badge-muted">$20</span>
                <span class="badge badge-muted">Furniture &amp; Home</span>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" style="margin-top: var(--sp-3)">Post it</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="idea-caption">
            <p class="idea-title">One line</p>
            <p class="idea-desc">The seller types one sentence and the price and category are read out of it. It posts on a weak connection, and a listing with no photo gives a buyer nothing to judge.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wf-ex wf-ex-vignette">
      <div class="wf">
          <div class="vignette">
            <div class="float" style="max-width: 280px">
              <p class="t-body-strong" style="margin: 0 0 var(--sp-2)">Recent photos</p>
              <div class="grid-3">
                <label class="choice" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: var(--sp-1)"><span class="media" style="display: block; height: var(--sp-12)"></span><span class="row"><input type="checkbox" checked><span class="t-caption">Couch</span></span></label>
                <label class="choice" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: var(--sp-1)"><span class="media" style="display: block; height: var(--sp-12)"></span><span class="row"><input type="checkbox" checked><span class="t-caption">Table</span></span></label>
                <label class="choice" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: var(--sp-1)"><span class="media" style="display: block; height: var(--sp-12)"></span><span class="row"><input type="checkbox" checked><span class="t-caption">Lamp</span></span></label>
                <label class="choice" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: var(--sp-1)"><span class="media" style="display: block; height: var(--sp-12)"></span><span class="row"><input type="checkbox" checked><span class="t-caption">Lamp</span></span></label>
                <label class="choice" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: var(--sp-1)"><span class="media" style="display: block; height: var(--sp-12)"></span><span class="row"><input type="checkbox"><span class="t-caption">Lamp</span></span></label>
                <label class="choice" style="flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: var(--sp-1)"><span class="media" style="display: block; height: var(--sp-12)"></span><span class="row"><input type="checkbox"><span class="t-caption">Rug</span></span></label>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" style="margin-top: var(--sp-3)">Draft a listing for each</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="idea-caption">
            <p class="idea-title">Batch from the camera roll</p>
            <p class="idea-desc">The seller ticks several photos and each becomes a draft listing. It fits a moving weekend, and every draft still waits for a price before it posts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wf-ex wf-ex-vignette">
      <div class="wf">
          <div class="vignette">
            <div class="float" style="max-width: 280px">
              <div class="media" style="height: var(--sp-23)"></div>
              <div class="row" style="margin-top: var(--sp-3); justify-content: space-between">
                <span class="t-body-strong">On the curb</span>
                <span class="badge">Free</span>
              </div>
              <p class="t-small muted" style="margin: var(--sp-1) 0 var(--sp-3)">Take what you want. Gone when it's gone.</p>
              <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Post the pile</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="idea-caption">
            <p class="idea-title">Free pile</p>
            <p class="idea-desc">One photo of everything on the curb posts as a single free listing with no title and no price. It is the shortest path for a giveaway and it cannot sell anything.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wf-ex wf-ex-vignette">
      <div class="wf">
          <div class="vignette">
            <div class="float" style="max-width: 280px">
              <div class="row" style="align-items: flex-start; gap: var(--sp-3)">
                <span class="avatar"></span>
                <div class="grow">
                  <p class="t-body-strong" style="margin: 0">Looking for a bookshelf</p>
                  <p class="t-small muted" style="margin: 0">Wanted · Priya, 3 min walk</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" style="margin-top: var(--sp-3)">I have one</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="idea-caption">
            <p class="idea-title">Answer a Wanted listing</p>
            <p class="idea-desc">A neighbor's Wanted listing carries an "I have one" button, so the item goes to a buyer who is waiting. It depends on Wanted listings, and a new neighborhood has few.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="visual-label wf-ex-second">The wireframes: photo-first, resolved into screens</div>
  <div class="wf-ex-row">

    <div class="wf-ex wf-ex-screen">
      <p class="wf-ex-plate">Browse</p>
      <div class="wf" style="position: relative;">
          <div class="row" style="justify-content: space-between; padding: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-4) 0">
            <span class="t-caption">9:41</span>
            <span class="row" aria-hidden="true"><span class="icon icon-sm"></span><span class="icon icon-sm"></span><span class="icon icon-sm"></span></span>
          </div>
          <header class="appbar" style="position: relative">
            <div class="grow text-stack">
              <span class="t-body-strong">Capitol Hill</span>
              <span class="t-caption muted">Items within a 10-min walk</span>
            </div>
            <div class="note-marker" style="top: var(--sp-3); right: var(--sp-4)">1</div>
          </header>
          <div style="position: relative; padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-12) var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4)">
            <div class="row" style="flex-wrap: wrap">
              <button class="chip active">All</button>
              <button class="chip">Free</button>
              <button class="chip">Trade</button>
              <button class="chip">Furniture &amp; Home</button>
              <button class="chip">Kids &amp; Baby</button>
              <button class="chip">Books &amp; Media</button>
              <button class="chip">Posted today</button>
            </div>
            <div class="note-marker" style="top: var(--sp-3); right: var(--sp-4)">2</div>
          </div>
          <div class="list">
          <div style="position: relative; padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4); background: var(--w-surface)">
            <span class="t-body-strong">On your block</span>
            <div class="note-marker" style="top: var(--sp-2); right: var(--sp-4)">3</div>
          </div>
          <div style="position: relative">
            <button class="list-row">
              <span class="media" style="width: var(--sp-16); height: var(--sp-16); flex-shrink: 0"></span>
              <span class="grow text-stack">
                <span class="t-body-strong">Moving boxes</span>
                <span class="t-small muted">1 min walk · Neighbor since 2021</span>
              </span>
              <span class="badge" style="flex-shrink: 0">Free</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div style="position: relative">
            <button class="list-row">
              <span class="media" style="width: var(--sp-16); height: var(--sp-16); flex-shrink: 0"></span>
              <span class="grow text-stack">
                <span class="t-body-strong">Coffee table</span>
                <span class="t-small muted">1 min walk · Neighbor since October</span>
              </span>
              <span class="t-body-strong" style="flex-shrink: 0">$20</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div style="position: relative; padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4); background: var(--w-surface)">
            <span class="t-body-strong">5-min walk</span>
          </div>
          <div style="position: relative">
            <button class="list-row">
              <span class="media" style="width: var(--sp-16); height: var(--sp-16); flex-shrink: 0"></span>
              <span class="grow text-stack">
                <span class="t-body-strong">Desk lamp</span>
                <span class="t-small muted">4 min walk · Neighbor since March</span>
              </span>
              <span class="t-body-strong" style="flex-shrink: 0">$15</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div style="position: relative">
            <button class="list-row">
              <span class="media" style="width: var(--sp-16); height: var(--sp-16); flex-shrink: 0"></span>
              <span class="grow text-stack">
                <span class="t-body-strong">Kids bike, 16-inch</span>
                <span class="t-small muted">4 min walk · Neighbor since 2022</span>
                <span style="margin-top: var(--sp-1)"><span class="stamp stamp-muted">Pending pickup</span></span>
              </span>
              <span class="t-body-strong" style="flex-shrink: 0">$35</span>
            </button>
            <div class="note-marker" style="top: 0; right: 0">4</div>
          </div>
          <div style="position: relative">
            <button class="list-row">
              <span class="media" style="width: var(--sp-16); height: var(--sp-16); flex-shrink: 0"></span>
              <span class="grow text-stack">
                <span class="t-body-strong">Lemons from our tree</span>
                <span class="t-small muted">5 min walk · Neighbor since 2019</span>
              </span>
              <span class="badge" style="flex-shrink: 0">Free</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div style="position: relative; padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4); background: var(--w-surface)">
            <span class="t-body-strong">10-min walk</span>
          </div>
          <div style="position: relative">
            <button class="list-row">
              <span class="media" style="width: var(--sp-16); height: var(--sp-16); flex-shrink: 0"></span>
              <span class="grow text-stack">
                <span class="t-body-strong">Cast iron skillet</span>
                <span class="t-small muted">8 min walk · Neighbor since June</span>
              </span>
              <span class="t-body-strong" style="flex-shrink: 0">Trade</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div style="position: relative">
            <button class="list-row">
              <span class="media" style="width: var(--sp-16); height: var(--sp-16); flex-shrink: 0"></span>
              <span class="grow text-stack">
                <span class="t-body-strong">Stroller</span>
                <span class="t-small muted">9 min walk · Neighbor since 2023</span>
              </span>
              <span class="t-body-strong" style="flex-shrink: 0">$40</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          </div>
          <nav class="tabbar">
            <button class="tab"><span class="icon icon-md" aria-hidden="true"></span>Explore</button>
            <button class="tab active"><span class="icon icon-md" aria-hidden="true"></span>List</button>
            <div style="position: relative; flex: 1; display: flex">
              <button class="tab" data-go="scr-post"><span class="glyph gl-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>Post</button>
              <div class="note-marker" style="top: 0; right: 0">5</div>
            </div>
            <button class="tab"><span class="icon icon-md" aria-hidden="true"></span>Activity</button>
            <button class="tab"><span class="icon icon-md" aria-hidden="true"></span>You</button>
          </nav>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wf-ex wf-ex-screen">
      <p class="wf-ex-plate">Post an item</p>
      <div class="wf" style="position: relative;">
          <div class="row" style="justify-content: space-between; padding: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-4) 0">
            <span class="t-caption">9:41</span>
            <span class="row" aria-hidden="true"><span class="icon icon-sm"></span><span class="icon icon-sm"></span><span class="icon icon-sm"></span></span>
          </div>
          <header class="appbar">
            <button class="btn-icon" aria-label="Close" data-go="scr-browse"><span class="glyph gl-x" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
            <span class="t-heading grow">Post an item</span>
          </header>
          <div style="position: relative">
            <div class="media" style="height: calc(var(--sp-20) * 3); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
              <span class="t-caption muted">Photo of the bookshelf</span>
            </div>
            <div class="note-marker" style="top: var(--sp-3); left: var(--sp-3)">1</div>
            <div class="row" style="justify-content: space-between; padding: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-4) 0">
              <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm"><span class="glyph glyph-sm gl-camera" aria-hidden="true"></span>Retake</button>
              <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm"><span class="glyph glyph-sm gl-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>Add a photo</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-body">
            <label class="field">
              <span class="field-label">Title</span>
              <input class="input" type="text" value="Blue IKEA bookshelf">
              <span class="field-hint" style="display: block">Suggested from your photo.</span>
            </label>
            <div style="position: relative; margin-top: var(--sp-4)">
              <div class="row" style="align-items: flex-end">
                <label class="field grow">
                  <span class="field-label">Price</span>
                  <input class="input" type="text" inputmode="decimal" value="$25">
                </label>
                <button class="chip" style="height: var(--h-md)">Free</button>
                <button class="chip" style="height: var(--h-md)">Trade</button>
              </div>
              <div class="note-marker" style="top: 0; right: 0">2</div>
            </div>
            <div class="field" style="margin-top: var(--sp-4)">
              <span class="field-label" id="post-cat">Category</span>
              <button class="select" aria-labelledby="post-cat">Furniture &amp; Home</button>
              <span class="field-hint" style="display: block">Suggested from your photo.</span>
            </div>
            <div role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="post-pickup" style="position: relative; margin-top: var(--sp-4)">
              <span class="field-label" id="post-pickup">How should they pick it up?</span>
              <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="pickup" checked><span>Porch pickup</span></label>
              <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="pickup"><span>Meet outside</span></label>
              <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="pickup"><span>Flexible</span></label>
              <span class="field-hint" style="display: block">Filled from your last listing.</span>
              <div class="note-marker" style="top: 0; right: 0">3</div>
            </div>
            <div class="field" style="margin-top: var(--sp-4)">
              <span class="field-label" id="post-when">Available for pickup</span>
              <button class="select" aria-labelledby="post-when">Today, until 8 pm</button>
            </div>
            <div style="position: relative; margin-top: var(--sp-6); padding-right: var(--sp-8)">
              <p class="t-small muted" style="margin: 0">Neighbors within a 20-min walk will see this. Your address stays hidden until you accept a pickup. No fees.</p>
              <div class="note-marker" style="top: 0; right: 0">4</div>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg btn-block" style="margin-top: var(--sp-3)" data-go="scr-posted">Post it</button>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wf-ex wf-ex-screen">
      <p class="wf-ex-plate">Posted</p>
      <div class="wf" style="position: relative;">
          <div class="row" style="justify-content: space-between; padding: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-4) 0">
            <span class="t-caption">9:41</span>
            <span class="row" aria-hidden="true"><span class="icon icon-sm"></span><span class="icon icon-sm"></span><span class="icon icon-sm"></span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="screen-body">
            <div style="position: relative; padding-right: var(--sp-8)">
              <span class="glyph glyph-lg gl-check" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <p class="t-display" style="margin: var(--sp-2) 0 var(--sp-1)">Posted</p>
              <p class="t-body muted" style="margin: 0">842 neighbors within a 20-min walk can see your bookshelf.</p>
              <div class="note-marker" style="top: 0; right: 0">1</div>
            </div>
            <div style="position: relative; margin-top: var(--sp-6)">
              <p class="t-small muted" style="margin: 0 0 var(--sp-2); padding-right: var(--sp-8)">What your neighbors see</p>
              <div class="note-marker" style="top: 0; right: 0">2</div>
              <div class="card">
                <div class="media" style="height: calc(var(--sp-20) * 2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
                  <span class="t-caption muted">Photo of the bookshelf</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                  <div class="row" style="justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start">
                    <span class="t-body-strong">Blue IKEA bookshelf</span>
                    <span class="t-body-strong" style="flex-shrink: 0">$25</span>
                  </div>
                  <p class="t-small muted" style="margin: var(--sp-1) 0 0">Porch pickup · Today, until 8 pm</p>
                  <div class="row" style="margin-top: var(--sp-2)">
                    <span class="avatar avatar-sm"></span>
                    <span class="t-caption muted">You · Neighbor since March</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="position: relative; padding-top: var(--sp-8)">
              <div class="note-marker" style="top: var(--sp-1); right: 0">3</div>
              <div class="callout">
                <span class="glyph gl-bell" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <div class="callout-body">
                  <p class="callout-title" style="margin: 0">You'll get a notification when a neighbor wants it</p>
                  <p class="callout-text" style="margin: 0">Nothing to check until then.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="position: relative; padding-top: var(--sp-8)">
              <div class="note-marker" style="top: var(--sp-1); right: 0">4</div>
              <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg btn-block" data-go="scr-post">Post another item</button>
              <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg btn-block" style="margin-top: var(--sp-2)" data-go="scr-browse">Done</button>
              <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-block" style="margin-top: var(--sp-2)">Edit listing</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
